From 5a8583e932fcb46f4edd58224233368dbed4e656 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Guy Nisan <gnisan@habana.ai>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2020 13:03:47 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-14676] fit: load and run image api

In preparation of loading FIT images by other transports than LKD, FIT
image load and run logic is moved from LKD into the FIT module.
This prevents duplicate coding and simplify the API for FIT handling for
other transports to use.

Change-Id: If9446bca5b8c6a53fc9d895e82f7952d2e68cb2f
Signed-off-by: Guy Nisan <gnisan@habana.ai>
---

